{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_34","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"fetch","tool":"fetch","arguments":{"max_length":10000,"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_in_China"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Contents of https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_in_China:\nFrom Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| |  |  |  |  | | --- | --- | --- | --- | | ←   * [2022](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_in_China \"2022 in China\") * [2021](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2021_in_China \"2021 in China\") * [2020](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_in_China \"2020 in China\") * [2019](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_in_China \"2019 in China\") * [2018](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2018_in_China \"2018 in China\") |  | [2023](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AD_2023 \"AD 2023\")  in  [China](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People's_Republic_of_China \"People's Republic of China\") | →   * [2024](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_in_China \"2024 in China\") * [2025](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_in_China \"2025 in China\") * [2026](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_in_China \"2026 in China\") * [2027](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2027_in_China \"2027 in China\") * [2028](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AD_2028 \"AD 2028\") | | |\n| Decades: | * [2000s](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:2000s_in_China \"Category:2000s in China\") * [2010s](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:2010s_in_China \"Category:2010s in China\") * **[2020s](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:2020s_in_China \"Category:2020s in China\")** |\n| See also: | [Other events of 2023](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023 \"2023\") [History of China](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_China \"History of China\")  •  [Timeline](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Timeline_of_Chinese_history \"Timeline of Chinese history\")  •  [Years](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_years_in_China \"List of years in China\") |\n\nEvents in the year **[2023](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023 \"2023\") in [China](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China \"China\")**.\n\n* [General Secretary of the Chinese Communist Party](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Secretary_of_the_Chinese_Communist_Party \"General Secretary of the Chinese Communist Party\") – [Xi Jinping](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xi_Jinping \"Xi Jinping\")\n* [President](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/President_of_China \"President of China\") – [Xi Jinping](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xi_Jinping \"Xi Jinping\")\n* [Vice President](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vice_President_of_China \"Vice President of China\")\n  + [Wang Qishan](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wang_Qishan \"Wang Qishan\") (until 10 March 2023)\n  + [Han Zheng](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Han_Zheng \"Han Zheng\") (from 10 March 2023)\n* [Premier](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Premier_of_China \"Premier of China\")\n  + [Li Keqiang](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Li_Keqiang \"Li Keqiang\") (until 11 March 2023)\n  + [Li Qiang](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Li_Qiang \"Li Qiang\") (from 11 March 2023)\n* [Congress chairman](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chairman_of_the_Standing_Committee_of_the_National_People's_Congress \"Chairman of the Standing Committee of the National People's Congress\") – [Li Zhanshu](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Li_Zhanshu \"Li Zhanshu\")\n* [Consultative Conference chairman](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chairman_of_the_National_Committee_of_the_Chinese_People's_Political_Consultative_Conference \"Chairman of the National Committee of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference\") – [Wang Yang](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wang_Yang_(politician) \"Wang Yang (politician)\")\n* [Supervision Commission director](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Director_of_the_National_Supervisory_Commission \"Director of the National Supervisory Commission\") – [Yang Xiaodu](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yang_Xiaodu \"Yang Xiaodu\")\n\n* 8 January – 17 people are killed and 22 others injured when a truck hits a [funeral procession](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Funeral_procession \"Funeral procession\") in [Nanchang County](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nanchang_County \"Nanchang County\"), [Jiangxi](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jiangxi \"Jiangxi\").[[1]](#cite_note-1)\n* 11 January – [2023 Guangzhou car attack](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_Guangzhou_car_attack \"2023 Guangzhou car attack\"): Five people are killed and 13 others injured when a man [rams his vehicle](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vehicle-ramming_attack \"Vehicle-ramming attack\") into a crowd in [Guangzhou](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guangzhou \"Guangzhou\"), [Guangdong](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guangdong \"Guangdong\").[[2]](#cite_note-2)\n* 17 January – [2023 Nyingchi avalanche](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_Nyingchi_avalanche \"2023 Nyingchi avalanche\"): An [avalanche](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Avalanche \"Avalanche\") in [Nyingchi](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nyingchi \"Nyingchi\"), [Tibet](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tibet \"Tibet\"), kills 28 people.[[3]](#cite_note-3)\n* 4 February – At least 16 people are killed and 66 others injured in a [multiple-vehicle collision](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multiple-vehicle_collision \"Multiple-vehicle collision\") along a highway in [Changsha](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Changsha \"Changsha\"), [Hunan](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunan \"Hunan\").[[4]](#cite_note-4)\n* 12 February – [2023 Shandong high-altitude object](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_Shandong_high-altitude_object \"2023 Shandong high-altitude object\"): China said that it detected an [unidentified flying object](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unidentified_flying_object \"Unidentified flying object\") over the [Yellow Sea](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yellow_Sea \"Yellow Sea\"), and warns that it is prepared to shoot it down. The Qingdao Marine Development Bureau issues an alert to fishermen in the waters to be \"on alert\" and \"avoid risks\".[[5]](#cite_note-5)\n* 22 February – [Alxa Left Banner mine collapse](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alxa_Left_Banner_mine_collapse \"Alxa Left Banner mine collapse\"): 53 people are killed by a [collapse](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mining_accident \"Mining accident\") at a [coal mine](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coal_mining \"Coal mining\") in [Alxa League](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alxa_League \"Alxa League\"), [Inner Mongolia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inner_Mongolia \"Inner Mongolia\").[[6]](#cite_note-6)\n* April – [India](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/India \"India\") surpasses China as the world's most populous country.[[7]](#cite_note-7)\n* 19 April – [2023 Beijing hospital fire](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_Beijing_hospital_fire \"2023 Beijing hospital fire\"): Twenty-nine people are killed by a fire in a hospital in [Beijing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beijing \"Beijing\").[[8]](#cite_note-BBC20230419-8)\n* 13 May – [Li Haoshi controversy](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Li_Haoshi_controversy \"Li Haoshi controversy\")\n* 28 May – First flight of the [Comac C919](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Comac_C919 \"Comac C919\"), China's first domestically made passenger aircraft, takes place between [Shanghai Hongqiao Airport](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shanghai_Hongqiao_Airport \"Shanghai Hongqiao Airport\") and [Beijing Capital Airport](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beijing_Capital_Airport \"Beijing Capital Airport\").[[9]](#cite_note-9)\n* 4 June – 19 people are killed by a [landslide](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Landslide \"Landslide\") at a mine in [Leshan](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leshan \"Leshan\") city of [Sichuan](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sichuan \"Sichuan\").[[10]](#cite_note-10)\n* 21 June – [2023 Yinchuan gas explosion](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_Yinchuan_gas_explosion \"2023 Yinchuan gas explosion\"): At least 31 people are killed and seven injured by a [gas explosion](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gas_explosion \"Gas explosion\") at a barbecue restaurant in the city of [Yinchuan](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yinchuan \"Yinchuan\") in the northwest [Ningxia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ningxia \"Ningxia\") region. The [explosion](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Explosion \"Explosion\") was caused by a leak in a [liquefied gas](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liquefied_gas \"Liquefied gas\") tank inside the restaurant.[[11]](#cite_note-11)\n* 10 July – Six people, including three children, are killed and one injured in an early morning [knife attack at a kindergarten](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_Lianjiang_stabbing \"2023 Lianjiang stabbing\") in [Lianjiang](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lianjiang,_Guangdong \"Lianjiang, Guangdong\"), Guangdong.[[12]](#cite_note-12)\n* 23 July – [2023 Qiqihar school gymnasium collapse](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_Qiqihar_school_gymnasium_collapse \"2023 Qiqihar school gymnasium collapse\"): 11 people are killed by the collapse of a school gym in [Qiqihar](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qiqihar \"Qiqihar\"), [Heilongjiang](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heilongjiang \"Heilongjiang\").\n* 2 August – [Typhoon Doksuri](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Typhoon_Doksuri \"Typhoon Doksuri\") brings heavy rainfall to Beijing and [Hebei](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hebei \"Hebei\"). In [Changping](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Changping,_Beijing \"Changping, Beijing\"), it sets a maximum rainfall record since record-keeping began in 1883.[[13]](#cite_note-bj1-13) At least 80 people are killed and 35 missing by flooding in localities of Beijing, Hebei, [Jilin](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jilin \"Jilin\") and [Liaoning](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liaoning \"Liaoning\").[[14]](#cite_note-INDIATV-14)[[15]](#cite_note-15)\n* 11 August – 24 people are killed and 3 are missing after a [flash flood](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flash_flood \"Flash flood\") and [landslides](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Landslide \"Landslide\") in the village of Weiziping in [Chang'an](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chang'an,_Xi'an \"Chang'an, Xi'an\"), [Xi'an](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xi'an \"Xi'an\").[[16]](#cite_note-16)\n* 8 September – Flooding occurs in [Guangdong](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guangdong_Province \"Guangdong Province\") and [Fujian](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fujian_Province \"Fujian Province\") province in [southern China](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Southern_China \"Southern China\") \n\n<error>Content truncated. Call the fetch tool with a start_index of 10000 to get more content.</error>"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
