{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_53","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"fetch","tool":"fetch","arguments":{"max_length":10000,"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/15th_BRICS_summit"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Contents of https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/15th_BRICS_summit:\nFrom Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\n| 2023 BRICS summit *15th BRICS summit* | |\n| --- | --- |\n| ← [14th](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/14th_BRICS_summit \"14th BRICS summit\")  22–24 August 2023  [16th](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/16th_BRICS_summit \"16th BRICS summit\") → | |\n|  | |\n|  | |\n| Host country | [South Africa](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Africa \"South Africa\") |\n| Cities | [Johannesburg](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johannesburg \"Johannesburg\") |\n| Venues | Sandton Convention Centre |\n| Participants | [Brazil](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brazil \"Brazil\")  [Russia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russia \"Russia\")  [India](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/India \"India\")  [China](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China \"China\")  [South Africa](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Africa \"South Africa\") **Invited bodies**:  [African Union](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/African_Union \"African Union\") [Arab Maghreb Union](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arab_Maghreb_Union \"Arab Maghreb Union\")  [Organisation of Islamic Cooperation](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Organisation_of_Islamic_Cooperation \"Organisation of Islamic Cooperation\")  [United Nations](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Nations \"United Nations\")   [ASEAN](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ASEAN \"ASEAN\")[[1]](#cite_note-1) |\n| Chair | [Cyril Ramaphosa](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyril_Ramaphosa \"Cyril Ramaphosa\"), [President of South Africa](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/President_of_South_Africa \"President of South Africa\") |\n| Website | [www.brics2023.gov.za](https://www.brics2023.gov.za/) |\n\nThe **2023 BRICS summit** was the [fifteenth](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BRICS#Summits \"BRICS\") annual [BRICS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BRICS \"BRICS\") summit, an international relations conference attended by the heads of state or heads of government of the five member states: [Brazil](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brazil \"Brazil\"), [Russia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russia \"Russia\"), [India](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/India \"India\"), [China](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China \"China\"), and [South Africa](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Africa \"South Africa\").[[2]](#cite_note-reuters_2023-06-29-2)[[3]](#cite_note-guardian_2023-05-30-3) South African President [Cyril Ramaphosa](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyril_Ramaphosa \"Cyril Ramaphosa\") also invited the leaders of 67 countries to the summit.[[4]](#cite_note-4)\n\nSeveral countries have expressed interest in joining the BRICS group.[[5]](#cite_note-5) At the summit, South African President Cyril Ramaphosa announced that [Argentina](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Argentina \"Argentina\"), [Egypt](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egypt \"Egypt\"), [Ethiopia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ethiopia \"Ethiopia\"), [Iran](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iran \"Iran\"), [Saudi Arabia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saudi_Arabia \"Saudi Arabia\"), and the [United Arab Emirates](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Arab_Emirates \"United Arab Emirates\") have been invited to join the bloc. Full membership took effect on 1 January 2024.[[6]](#cite_note-6)[[7]](#cite_note-7)\n\n## Participating leaders\n\n[[edit](/w/index.php?title=15th_BRICS_summit&action=edit&section=3 \"Edit section: Participating leaders\")]\n\n* [![Brazil Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva, President](//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Lula_%2805-09-2024%29.jpg/120px-Lula_%2805-09-2024%29.jpg)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Lula_(05-09-2024).jpg \" BrazilLuiz Inácio Lula da Silva, President\")\n* [![Russia Sergei Lavrov, Foreign Minister](//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/%D0%A1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B3%D0%B5%D0%B9_%D0%9B%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2_%2814-02-2022%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-%D0%A1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B3%D0%B5%D0%B9_%D0%9B%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2_%2814-02-2022%29_%28cropped%29.jpg)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%A1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B3%D0%B5%D0%B9_%D0%9B%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2_(14-02-2022)_(cropped).jpg \" RussiaSergei Lavrov, Foreign Minister\")\n* [![Russia Vladimir Putin, President](//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Vladimir_Putin_%282020-02-20%29.jpg/120px-Vladimir_Putin_%282020-02-20%29.jpg)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Vladimir_Putin_(2020-02-20).jpg \" RussiaVladimir Putin, President (participating virtually)\")\n* [![India Narendra Modi, Prime Minister](//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/PM_Modi_Portrait%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-PM_Modi_Portrait%28cropped%29.jpg)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:PM_Modi_Portrait(cropped).jpg \" IndiaNarendra Modi, Prime Minister\")\n* [![China Xi Jinping, Paramount leader](//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Xi_Jinping_2019.jpg/120px-Xi_Jinping_2019.jpg)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Xi_Jinping_2019.jpg \" ChinaXi Jinping, CCP General Secretary and President\")\n* [![South AfricaCyril Ramaphosa, President (Host)](//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/2019_Reuni%C3%A3o_Informal_do_BRICS_-_48142657142_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-2019_Reuni%C3%A3o_Informal_do_BRICS_-_48142657142_%28cropped%29.jpg)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:2019_Reuni%C3%A3o_Informal_do_BRICS_-_48142657142_(cropped).jpg \" South AfricaCyril Ramaphosa, President (Host)\")\n\n| Country | Position | Officeholder | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [Algeria](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Algeria \"Algeria\") | Finance Minister | [Laaziz Fayed](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laaziz_Fayed \"Laaziz Fayed\") | [[10]](#cite_note-dzgov-11) |\n| [Angola](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angola \"Angola\") | State Minister of Economic Coordenation | [José de Lima Massano](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jos%C3%A9_de_Lima_Massano?action=edit&redlink=1 \"José de Lima Massano (page does not exist)\") | [[11]](#cite_note-:0-12) |\n| [Bangladesh](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bangladesh \"Bangladesh\") | Prime Minister | [Sheikh Hasina](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sheikh_Hasina \"Sheikh Hasina\") | [[12]](#cite_note-13) |\n| [Belarus](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Belarus \"Belarus\") | Foreign Minister | [Sergei Aleinik](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sergei_Aleinik \"Sergei Aleinik\") | [[13]](#cite_note-Belarus-14) |\n| [Bolivia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bolivia \"Bolivia\") | President | [Luis Arce](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luis_Arce \"Luis Arce\") | [[14]](#cite_note-Bolivian-15) |\n| [Botswana](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Botswana \"Botswana\") | Vice President | [Slumber Tsogwane](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slumber_Tsogwane \"Slumber Tsogwane\") | [[15]](#cite_note-16) |\n| [Burundi](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burundi \"Burundi\") | President | [Evariste Ndayishimiye](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evariste_Ndayishimiye \"Evariste Ndayishimiye\") | [[16]](#cite_note-17) |\n| [Cameroon](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cameroon \"Cameroon\") | Prime Minister | [Joseph Ngute](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joseph_Ngute \"Joseph Ngute\") | [[17]](#cite_note-:2-18) |\n| [Central African Republic](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Central_African_Republic \"Central African Republic\") | President | [Faustin-Archange Touadera](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faustin-Archange_Touadera \"Faustin-Archange Touadera\") | [[18]](#cite_note-19) |\n| [China](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China \"China\") | [Commerce Minister](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ministry_of_Commerce_(China) \"Ministry of Commerce (China)\") | [Wang Wentao](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wang_Wentao \"Wang Wentao\") | [[19]](#cite_note-reuters_2023-08-22-20) |\n| [Congo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republic_of_the_Congo \"Republic of the Congo\") | President | [Denis Sassou Nguesso](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Denis_Sassou_Nguesso \"Denis Sassou Nguesso\") | [[20]](#cite_note-21) |\n| [Cuba](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cuba \"Cuba\") | First Secretary President | [Miguel Díaz-Canel](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miguel_D%C3%ADaz-Canel \"Miguel Díaz-Canel\") | [[21]](#cite_note-22) |\n| [DR Congo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Republic_of_the_Congo \"Democratic Republic of the Congo\") | Prime Minister | [Jean-Michel Sama Lukonde](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean-Michel_Sama_Lukonde \"Jean-Michel Sama Lukonde\") | [[22]](#cite_note-23) |\n| [Egypt](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egypt \"Egypt\") | Prime Minister | [Mostafa Madbouly](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mostafa_Madbouly \"Mostafa Madbouly\") | [[23]](#cite_note-:1-24) |\n| [Ethiopia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ethiopia \"Ethiopia\") | Prime Minister | [Abiy Ahmed](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abiy_Ahmed \"Abiy Ahmed\") | [[24]](#cite_note-25) |\n| [Equatorial Guinea](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equatorial_Guinea \"Equatorial Guinea\") | President | [Teodoro Obiang Nguema Mbasogo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teodoro_Obiang_Nguema_Mbasogo \"Teodoro Obiang Nguema Mbasogo\") | [[25]](#cite_note-26) |\n| [Eritrea](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eritrea \"Eritrea\") | President | [Isaias Afwerki](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isaias_Afwerki \"Isaias Afwerki\") | [[26]](#cite_note-27) |\n| [Ghana](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghana \"Ghana\") | President | [Nana Akufo-Addo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nana_Akufo-Addo \"Nana Akufo-Addo\") | [[27]](#cite_note-28) |\n| [Indonesia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indonesia \"Indonesia\") | President | [Joko Widodo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joko_Widodo \"Joko Widodo\") | [[28]](#cite_note-29) |\n| [Iran](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iran \"Iran\") | President | [Ebrahim Raisi](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ebrahim_Raisi \"Ebrahim Raisi\") | [[29]](#cite_note-30) |\n| [Libya](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Libya \"Libya\") | Vice President | [Musa Al-Koni](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Musa_Al-Koni \"Musa Al-Koni\") | [[30]](#cite_note-31) |\n| [Malawi](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malawi \"Malawi\") | President | [Lazarus Chakwera](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lazarus_Chakwera \"Lazarus Chakwera\") | [[17]](#cite_note-:2-18) |\n| [Mozambique](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mozambique \"Mozambique\") | President | [Filipe Nyusi](https://en.wikipedi\n\n<error>Content truncated. Call the fetch tool with a start_index of 10000 to get more content.</error>"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
